      "id": "p0199-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Two royal guards in Hotland block the way forward. Using patience and the proper choices, the player can convince the guards to reveal their hidden feelings for each other. During this process, using the \"Check\" command on the guards reveals two new descriptions:",
        "raw": "Two royal guards in Hotland block the way forward. Using patience and the\nproper choices, the player can convince the guards to reveal their hidden\nfeelings for each other. During this process, using the \"Check\" command on the\nguards reveals two new descriptions:",
