      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby noted that these are indirect, inaccurate quotes from the English translation of Kitchen, a famous novel by Japanese author Banana Yoshimoto. The exact English quote from Kitchen is:",
        "raw": "Toby noted that these are indirect, inaccurate quotes\nfrom the English translation of Kitchen, a famous\nnovel by Japanese author Banana Yoshimoto. The\nexact English quote from Kitchen is:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
