      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "'' Although I had been earnestly daydreaming until then, I suddenly started to laugh. \"I see two lovers looking over the edge of the cauldron of hell. Are they contemplating a double suicide? This means their love will end in hell.\" I couldn't stop laughing.",
        "raw": "'' Although I had been earnestly daydreaming\nuntil then, I suddenly started to laugh. \"I see two\nlovers looking over the edge of the cauldron of\nhell. Are they contemplating a double suicide?\nThis means their love will end in hell.\" I couldn't\nstop laughing.",
